From 84865e4458cb67c0f4ca0f03c769f0847f4a7ad9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: inkling-turing <inkling-turing@local>
Date: Sun, 22 Nov 2026 17:40:03 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] WIP (rejected, not accepted): relative bias computed in the
 mma flash attention mask loader (descriptor node, fattn_rel_params), unit
 tests bit-exact, model integration unstable

